{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO VERSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo offers ~40 minutes of gameplay, core features and simplified progression. The full game is planned to take 4\u20135 hours to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The world has forgotten its color.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Long ago, the Red Virus infected every system \u2014 spreading silence, fear, and uniformity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Now, a spark awakens.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You are the <strong>Neon Soul</strong> \u2014 a fragment of light born from the remnants of the old world.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to bring color to a world consumed by red.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather upgrades, wield them against the Red Virus, and watch as the system slowly regains its colors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Action</strong> \u2013 immerse yourself in a neon-drenched world filled with light, color, and motion</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Progression System</strong> \u2013 unlock new abilities and colors, enhance your light, and adapt your playstyle</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Flow Gameplay</strong> \u2013 intuitive, rhythmic mechanics designed for immersion rather than tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You are the heartbeat of a rebellion. You are the light of the new world. You are the <strong>Neon Soul</strong>.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steam