 system slowly regains its colors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Action</strong> \u2013 immerse yourself in a neon-drenched world filled with light, color, and motion</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Progression System</strong> \u2013 unlock new abilities and colors, enhance your light, and adapt your playstyle</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxed Flow Gameplay</strong> \u2013 intuitive, rhythmic mechanics designed for immersion rather than tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You are the heartbeat of a rebellion. You are the light of the new world. You are the <strong>Neon Soul</strong>.</i></p>","developers":["Pixel Spaghetti"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4114180","name":"Pulse of the Neon Soul"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129680/cd2b8d9f762a566069b1520c9091e5fd3f5e8af5/header.jpg?t=1761926675","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4129680/210460695/64a1a61dc46d379a0d7cbb71b9e5733a5034b770/1761139968/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761926673","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4129680/210460695/64a1a61dc46d379a0d7cbb71b9e5733a5034b770/1761139968/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761926673","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4129680/210460695/64a1a61dc46d379a0d7cbb71b9e5733a5034b770/1761139968/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761926673","id":257221058,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221058/movie480.mp4?t=1761926673","max":"h